---
const points = [
  'I ask why before I ask how. If the goal is unclear, I say so before building.',
  'I plan before I build and put the plan in writing.',
  'I write tests. If a codebase has none, that is the first thing I fix.',
  'I work directly with product owners and stakeholders, not through a ticket queue.',
  'I will tell you when a feature is not worth building, and suggest what to do instead.',
  'I have led teams and mentored engineers, so I can work alone or inside an existing team.',
];
---

<section id="how-i-work" class="py-[88px] border-t border-border">
  <div class="max-w-[1080px] mx-auto px-7">
    <span class="section-label animate">How I Work</span>
    <h2 class="section-title animate delay-1">Working with me</h2>
    <ul class="max-w-[640px] mt-6 space-y-3 animate delay-2">
      {points.map((point) => (
        <li class="text-[17px] text-text-secondary leading-relaxed flex gap-2.5">
          <span class="text-accent mt-3 flex-shrink-0 w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>{point}</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
